ment\">17-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"058f3c1c00535492\" href=\"?note=058f3c1c00535492\" title=\"17-df-symbol-alphabet\">17-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"1.3"},{"key":"source_result","html":"1.3.13"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27</span><span>28</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43</span><span>44</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; local equivalent formulation"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A=(A,\\mathcal I)\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak A=(A,\\mathcal I)\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(A)\">\\(\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(A)\\)</span>，分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9b641c11eab6e875\" href=\"?note=9b641c11eab6e875\" title=\"17-df-assignment\">17-df-assignment</a>。项及单字提升见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c40994941c97c4da\" href=\"?note=c40994941c97c4da\" title=\"17-df-term\">17-df-term</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"058f3c1c00535492\" href=\"?note=058f3c1c00535492\" title=\"17-df-symbol-alphabet\">17-df-symbol-alphabet</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L\">\\(t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L\\)</span>。各分支的参数局部取值：变量分支取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L\\)</span>，常元分支取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_L\">\\(c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_L\\)</span>；应用分支取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n}\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L^n\">\\(\\bar t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L^n\\)</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\leq i\\leq n\">\\(1\\leq i\\leq n\\)</span> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_i=\\bar t(i-1)\">\\(t_i=\\bar t(i-1)\\)</span>。这些局部声明不要求常元类或函数符号类非空。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^{\\mathfrak A}\">\\(f^{\\mathfrak A}\\)</span> 的单个输入是长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的值序列。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\mapsto t^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]\">\\(t\\mapsto t^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]\\)</span> 是下式按项结构递归定义的函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_L\\to A\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_L\\to A\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"t^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]\\coloneqq_{\\mathrm{ind}}\n\\begin{cases}\n\\beta(x),&amp;t=\\operatorname{lit}(x),\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L,\\\\\nc^{\\mathfrak A},&amp;t=\\operatorname{lit}(c),\\ c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_L,\\\\\nf^{\\mathfrak A}\\bigl(\\langle t_1^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta],\\ldots,t_n^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]\\rangle\\bigr),\n&amp;t=f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n),\\ f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n}.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[t^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]\\coloneqq_{\\mathrm{ind}}\n\\begin{cases}\n\\beta(x),&amp;t=\\operatorname{lit}(x),\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L,\\\\\nc^{\\mathfrak A},&amp;t=\\operatorname{lit}(c),\\ c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_L,\\\\\nf^{\\mathfrak A}\\bigl(\\langle t_1^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta],\\ldots,t_n^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]\\rangle\\bigr),\n&amp;t=f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n),\\ f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n}.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every branch has codomain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>; the recursive mechanism follows <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"aa8b746e678731ad\" href=\"?note=aa8b746e678731ad\" title=\"17-df-term-interpretation\">17-df-term-interpretation</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"c40994941c97c4da","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"9b641c11eab6e875","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"058f3c1c00535492","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-symbol-alphabet]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]",